sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Viewer
    participant TV as Fire TV App
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant POL as Spoiler Policy
    participant RET as Retrieval Service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL + pgvector
    participant LLM as LLM Provider

    U->>TV: Enter/select question
    TV->>API: POST /api/v1/ask
    API->>API: Validate session and request
    API->>POL: Resolve permitted story boundary
    POL-->>API: Retrieval policy
    API->>RET: Query + movie + policy
    RET->>DB: Filtered keyword/vector search
    DB-->>RET: Candidate chunks and facts
    RET->>RET: Rank and deduplicate
    RET-->>API: Permitted evidence

    alt Sufficient evidence
        API->>LLM: Bounded context + answer instructions
        LLM-->>API: Structured answer
        API->>API: Validate evidence and policy
        API-->>TV: Answer + sources
    else Insufficient evidence
        API-->>TV: Cannot answer reliably from available content
    end

    TV-->>U: Display answer
